{c_label}Dominance Cost:{/c_label} {c_warlockDominance}{Resource Cost}{/c}
{c_label}Passive:{/c} Valloch increases your Maximum {c_important}{u}Overpower{/u}{/c} by {c_number}{SF_2}{/c} and Maximum Wrath by {c_number}{SF_3}{/c}.

{c_label}Active{/c}: Command Valloch to siphon its power to overfill your {c_important}{u}Overpower{/u}{/c} by {c_number}{SF_4}{/c} and increase Wrath Regeneration by {c_number}[{SF_5}*100|+%|]{/c} for {c_number}{buffduration:SIPHON_BONUS}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_8} While its power is siphoned, {c_important}Occult Abyss{/c} Skills apply {c_number}{SF_9}{/c} additional stack of {c_important}{u}Hex{/u}{/c} to enemies.{/if}{if:SF_10} {c_important}{u}Fortify{/u}{/c} for {c_number}[{SF_11}*100|%|]{/c} of your Maximum Life, and, while its power is siphoned, Valloch pays {c_number}[{SF_12}*100|%|]{/c} of Life Costs instead of you.{/if}
